id: arcosian-raised-mark
name: Arcosian-Raised
kind: conditions
maxStacks: 3
# Not a Combat Condition: Arcosian-Raised (1)'s - a stack each hit, till the end of the turn.
combatCondition: no
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Arcosian-Raised: Wound Rolls 1(T) higher for each stack, until the end of your turn.
text: >
  Arcosian-Raised (1): If you hit an Opponent with an Attacking Maneuver, increase your Wound Rolls by 1(T) until the end of your turn.

---

[passive]
wound += stacks * 1(T);
